{"title":"Peanut Butter","description":"\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"350\" data-start=\"239\"\u003e\"Made from carefully roasted peanuts, our peanut butter promises an irresistible blend of taste and nutrition.\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"450\" data-start=\"353\"\u003e\"Whether you prefer it smooth or crunchy, every spoonful bursts with natural protein and energy.\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"570\" data-start=\"453\"\u003e\"Perfect for spreading, baking, or blending into your favorite recipes — our peanut butter brings joy to every bite.\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"662\" data-start=\"573\"\u003e\"Crafted with no added preservatives, just pure peanut goodness you can feel good about.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"candy-topping-peanut-butter","title":"Candy Topping Peanut Butter","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs a delicious, creamy blend of rich, roasted peanuts and sweet, tantalizing candy flavors, Candy Topping Peanut Butter is the perfect addition to your dessert spread. With a smooth consistency and indulgent taste, this topping will enhance any treat with a touch of nutty sweetness. Satisfy your cravings with Candy Topping Peanut Butter.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Indulgent Butters","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46595641147637,"sku":"","price":14.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0748\/7134\/1301\/files\/attachment_148851108.jpg?v=1745849757"},{"product_id":"candy-topping-peanut-butter-1","title":"Candy Topping Peanut Butter","description":"\u003cp\u003eMade with creamy peanut butter, our Candy Topping Peanut Butter is the perfect addition to any dessert. With its rich flavor and smooth texture, you can enhance your sweet treats with a delicious touch of nutty goodness. Elevate your desserts to the next level with our Candy Topping Peanut Butter.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Indulgent Butters","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46595658645749,"sku":"","price":14.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0748\/7134\/1301\/files\/attachment_149036382.jpg?v=1745849932"},{"product_id":"candy-topping-peanut-butter-2","title":"Candy Topping Peanut Butter","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis Candy Topping Peanut Butter is the perfect addition to your favorite ice cream, cookies or cupcakes. Made with fresh and creamy peanut butter, this topping adds a rich and delicious flavor to any dessert. Elevate your treats with this irresistible addition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Indulgent Butters","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46595661267189,"sku":"","price":14.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0748\/7134\/1301\/files\/attachment_149070569.jpg?v=1745850043"},{"product_id":"candy-topping-peanut-butter-3","title":"Candy Topping Peanut Butter","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your dessert game with our Candy Topping Peanut Butter. Made with real peanuts, it adds a creamy and nutty flavor to any treat. Plus, it's a great source of protein, making it a delicious and nutritious choice for any sweet indulgence. Get ready to take your taste buds on a delicious adventure!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Indulgent Butters","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46595672178933,"sku":"","price":14.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0748\/7134\/1301\/files\/attachment_148851166_6e0797d6-24f1-43e9-81ba-64a19b505cbe.jpg?v=1745850142"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0748\/7134\/1301\/collections\/image_2025-04-28_191448158_0331b150-46dd-4b2d-90b7-3f51b76fa3f9.png?v=1746019512","url":"https:\/\/vv4ea1-i3.myshopify.com\